<div class="panel">
	<h3><i class="icon icon-credit-card"></i> {l s='Tax Exemption Customer Groups' mod='taxexempt'}</h3>
	<p>
		<strong>{l s='Define your tax exempted customer groups!' mod='taxexempt'}</strong><br />
		{l s='With the help of this module, you will be able to declare the customer groups which are tax exempted.' mod='taxexempt'}<br />
		{l s='If the customer is belonged to any of the selected customer groups below, they will be tax exempted.' mod='taxexempt'}<br />
		{l s='If visitors customer group is chosen, all visitors including the customer will be tax exempted.' mod='taxexempt'}
	</p>
	<br />

</div>

<div class="panel">
	<h3><i class="icon icon-tags"></i> {l s='The "tax.excl." and "tax.incl." labels' mod='taxexempt'}</h3>
	<p>
		{l s='The labels of "tax.excl." and "tax.incl." will also be not visible to the tax-exempted groups.' mod='taxexempt'}<br />
		{l s='However, those labels should be cleared from the pdf invoice with the help of Prestashop\'s backoffice translations feature.' mod='taxexempt'}<br />
		{l s='To modify the pdf invoice\'s wordings please you need to go Backoffice>International>Translations>Theme Translations>Your Theme>Your language and search for the word "tax" and select Shop>Pdf from the tree.' mod='taxexempt'}
	</p>
</div>
